WEBVTT

1
00:00:36.125 --> 00:00:38.958
As we saw in the previous chapters,

2
00:00:38.958 --> 00:00:43.250
Lord Krishna showed us the path to liberation,

3
00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:46.541
clarified our relationship with the world,

4
00:00:46.541 --> 00:00:48.500
and gave detailed knowledge

5
00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:49.791
on karma-yoga

6
00:00:49.791 --> 00:00:51.416
and jnana-yoga.

7
00:00:51.416 --> 00:00:52.916
Now in this chapter,

8
00:00:52.916 --> 00:00:56.208
He speaks to us about bhakti-yoga –

9
00:00:56.208 --> 00:00:58.791
what devotion is, why it matters,

10
00:00:58.791 --> 00:01:02.875
and how it can connect us to
 Him in the most natural way.

11
00:01:07.750 --> 00:01:10.333
Why is Lord Krishna sharing

12
00:01:10.333 --> 00:01:12.500
this divine knowledge with Arjuna?

13
00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:14.833
What is special about Arjuna

14
00:01:14.833 --> 00:01:16.916
that, if present in us too,

15
00:01:16.916 --> 00:01:20.458
would make us worthy 
of this supreme knowledge?

16
00:01:20.458 --> 00:01:23.750
Lord Krishna says – ‘O Arjuna,

17
00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:26.416
I am giving you this knowledge

18
00:01:26.416 --> 00:01:29.250
because you are anasuyave –

19
00:01:29.250 --> 00:01:30.833
that is free from envy.

20
00:01:30.833 --> 00:01:33.375
Only one who is free from envy

21
00:01:33.375 --> 00:01:37.125
is worthy of understanding

22
00:01:37.125 --> 00:01:40.500
and absorbing this most secret knowledge.’

23
00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:42.958
Why does envy become an obstacle?

24
00:01:42.958 --> 00:01:47.125
Imagine – if you envy someone

25
00:01:47.125 --> 00:01:49.625
who is more capable or successful than you,

26
00:01:49.625 --> 00:01:51.833
can you truly learn from them?

27
00:01:51.833 --> 00:01:56.041
No. Because envy stops a person

28
00:01:56.041 --> 00:01:58.750
from accepting another’s greatness.

29
00:01:58.750 --> 00:02:00.666
One who is filled with envy

30
00:02:00.666 --> 00:02:03.750
may even envy Lord Krishna –

31
00:02:03.750 --> 00:02:06.791
thinking, ‘Why is He supreme?

32
00:02:06.791 --> 00:02:08.625
Why not me?’

33
00:02:08.625 --> 00:02:10.083
Such a mind

34
00:02:10.083 --> 00:02:11.875
can never accept

35
00:02:11.875 --> 00:02:13.666
Lord Krishna's teachings.

36
00:02:13.666 --> 00:02:16.166
But Arjuna is different.

37
00:02:16.166 --> 00:02:18.083
He not only respects Lord Krishna

38
00:02:18.083 --> 00:02:20.125
but is genuinely

39
00:02:20.125 --> 00:02:23.041
eager to learn from Him.

40
00:02:23.041 --> 00:02:27.291
And that is why he receives
 this divine knowledge.

41
00:02:27.291 --> 00:02:32.458
Now the question is, What is this
 supreme secret knowledge?

42
00:02:32.458 --> 00:02:34.708
Lord Krishna answers –

43
00:02:34.708 --> 00:02:38.125
‘Devotion is the simplest and most natural path.

44
00:02:38.125 --> 00:02:40.375
Devotion does not just give knowledge –

45
00:02:40.375 --> 00:02:42.875
it gives direct experience.’

46
00:02:42.875 --> 00:02:46.541
Understand the difference
 between jnana and vijnana –

47
00:02:46.541 --> 00:02:49.916
We have read and heard that honey is sweet –

48
00:02:49.916 --> 00:02:51.000
that is jnana, knowledge.

49
00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:53.750
But when we taste honey ourselves

50
00:02:53.750 --> 00:02:56.125
and experience its sweetness –

51
00:02:56.125 --> 00:02:57.583
that is vijnana, direct realisation.

52
00:02:57.583 --> 00:03:01.083
In the same way, devotion
  does not just show us the path –

53
00:03:01.083 --> 00:03:05.125
it gives us the direct experience of the Lord.

54
00:03:05.125 --> 00:03:06.833
Is that not wonderful?

55
00:03:06.833 --> 00:03:09.541
But now you may be wondering –

56
00:03:09.541 --> 00:03:12.541
‘What change can this
 devotion bring into our lives?’

57
00:03:12.541 --> 00:03:14.541
Lord Krishna says –

58
00:03:14.541 --> 00:03:17.833
‘This knowledge can free
 you from all the suffering of life,

59
00:03:17.833 --> 00:03:19.166
because it transforms

60
00:03:19.166 --> 00:03:21.083
the very way you live.’

61
00:03:21.083 --> 00:03:22.791
When we surrender ourselves

62
00:03:22.791 --> 00:03:24.958
to Lord Krishna,

63
00:03:24.958 --> 00:03:27.708
we stop doing the very things

64
00:03:27.708 --> 00:03:31.375
that would cause us suffering in the future.

65
00:03:31.375 --> 00:03:33.958
Devotion does not just give liberation –

66
00:03:33.958 --> 00:03:36.833
it fills life with joy.

67
00:03:36.833 --> 00:03:39.083
This is the glory of devotion –

68
00:03:39.083 --> 00:03:41.791
it is not just a thought, but an experience.

69
00:03:41.791 --> 00:03:44.458
Not just words, but reality.

70
00:03:44.458 --> 00:03:48.208
Not just understanding, but the
 felt realisation of the soul.

71
00:03:53.166 --> 00:03:59.333
Why did I gave Arjuna this
 most secret knowledge?

72
00:03:59.333 --> 00:04:03.000
Do you know the reason?

73
00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:05.541
Let me tell you,

74
00:04:05.541 --> 00:04:08.750
Because he was sincere, 

75
00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:13.666
eager to learn, and free from envy.

76
00:04:13.666 --> 00:04:16.291
When you keep your heart pure, simple,

77
00:04:16.291 --> 00:04:18.458
and free from envy,

78
00:04:18.458 --> 00:04:20.958
the doors of true knowledge

79
00:04:20.958 --> 00:04:24.291
and inner growth open for you.

80
00:04:24.291 --> 00:04:27.833
Know this – envy is a darkness

81
00:04:27.833 --> 00:04:32.375
that can cloud any person’s vision.

82
00:04:32.375 --> 00:04:35.375
It stops them from seeing another’s greatness –

83
00:04:35.375 --> 00:04:39.291
and from understanding My divinity.

84
00:04:39.291 --> 00:04:41.708
Imagine –

85
00:04:41.708 --> 00:04:45.958
a teacher had two students.

86
00:04:45.958 --> 00:04:49.875
One was arrogant, the other humble.

87
00:04:49.875 --> 00:04:53.291
The teacher gave both the same knowledge.

88
00:04:53.291 --> 00:04:56.541
But the arrogant one, drowning in envy,

89
00:04:56.541 --> 00:04:59.625
made no effort to truly learn.

90
00:04:59.625 --> 00:05:01.875
The humble one received it with reverence.

91
00:05:01.875 --> 00:05:04.041
One remained in ignorance,

92
00:05:04.041 --> 00:05:08.458
while the other was filled

93
00:05:08.458 --> 00:05:13.041
with the joy of knowledge.

94
00:05:13.041 --> 00:05:15.916
This is the truth of life.

95
00:05:15.916 --> 00:05:19.125
As long as envy veils the heart,

96
00:05:19.125 --> 00:05:21.083
the divine light of knowledge

97
00:05:21.083 --> 00:05:23.333
cannot enter within.

98
00:05:23.333 --> 00:05:25.458
Remember –

99
00:05:25.458 --> 00:05:29.708
My devotion is not limited to knowledge alone.

100
00:05:29.708 --> 00:05:32.916
It is the joyful experience of feeling
 Me within your heart

101
00:05:32.916 --> 00:05:34.791
and seeing My presence

102
00:05:34.791 --> 00:05:37.041
directly in your life.

103
00:05:37.041 --> 00:05:40.541
This path purifies the heart,

104
00:05:40.541 --> 00:05:43.791
destroys all suffering,

105
00:05:43.791 --> 00:05:46.500
and fills your life

106
00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:49.083
with peace

107
00:05:49.083 --> 00:05:52.583
and lasting joy.

108
00:05:52.583 --> 00:05:56.875
So let go of ego and envy.

109
00:05:56.875 --> 00:05:59.875
Become humble.

110
00:05:59.875 --> 00:06:02.458
And let devotion illuminate your life.

111
00:06:07.375 --> 00:06:10.500
Where envy is born,

112
00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:13.750
love begins to die.

113
00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:19.458
In family and society, if there
 is one great poison,

114
00:06:19.458 --> 00:06:22.166
it is envy.

115
00:06:22.166 --> 00:06:24.791
It quietly makes its home
 in the mind and creates

116
00:06:24.791 --> 00:06:29.250
distance in relationships.

117
00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:31.375
Imagine –

118
00:06:31.375 --> 00:06:34.750
two brothers live in the same house.

119
00:06:34.750 --> 00:06:36.875
The younger one works hard

120
00:06:36.875 --> 00:06:38.875
and achieves success

121
00:06:38.875 --> 00:06:40.291
in his field.

122
00:06:40.291 --> 00:06:44.250
Everyone in the family is happy.

123
00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:46.166
But

124
00:06:46.166 --> 00:06:48.291
the elder brother begins

125
00:06:48.291 --> 00:06:51.333
to envy him.

126
00:06:51.333 --> 00:06:53.916
Slowly, his words

127
00:06:53.916 --> 00:06:56.416
turn into taunts.

128
00:06:56.416 --> 00:06:59.541
Bitterness enters his behaviour.

129
00:06:59.541 --> 00:07:01.875
And a home filled with love

130
00:07:01.875 --> 00:07:04.500
becomes a ground for conflict.

131
00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:07.541
Now think – if the elder brother

132
00:07:07.541 --> 00:07:09.958
had let go of competition

133
00:07:09.958 --> 00:07:11.916
and envy,

134
00:07:11.916 --> 00:07:15.541
the doors of love and mutual
 respect would have stayed open.

135
00:07:15.541 --> 00:07:19.250
The family would have flourished in love and joy.

136
00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:23.208
And this is what makes
 the family happy and prosperous.

137
00:07:23.208 --> 00:07:25.166
Remember,

138
00:07:25.166 --> 00:07:28.500
just as devotion purifies the heart,

139
00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:33.708
love and mutual understanding
 purify relationships

140
00:07:33.708 --> 00:07:36.750
within the family.

141
00:07:36.750 --> 00:07:38.541
Always encourage one another

142
00:07:38.541 --> 00:07:44.666
to grow, and see the divine in every soul.

143
00:07:44.666 --> 00:07:46.541
When you do this,

144
00:07:46.541 --> 00:07:48.666
envy will never arise in your heart.

145
00:07:48.666 --> 00:07:51.416
And remember –

146
00:07:51.416 --> 00:07:55.333
where there is no envy, there is love.

147
00:07:55.333 --> 00:07:57.708
And where there is love –

148
00:07:57.708 --> 00:07:59.750
that is where I reside.

149
00:08:04.666 --> 00:08:08.750
When a colleague gets promoted,

150
00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:11.166
do you feel inspired –

151
00:08:11.166 --> 00:08:13.791
or envious?

152
00:08:13.791 --> 00:08:17.166
This very outlook determines
 the path of your own growth.

153
00:08:17.166 --> 00:08:19.625
The vision of envy is narrow –

154
00:08:19.625 --> 00:08:24.541
it stops us from recognising another's abilities.

155
00:08:24.541 --> 00:08:27.291
Competition is meaningful

156
00:08:27.291 --> 00:08:29.458
only as long as it inspires.

157
00:08:29.458 --> 00:08:32.250
When competition turns into envy,

158
00:08:32.250 --> 00:08:34.625
it becomes a cause of destruction.

159
00:08:34.625 --> 00:08:37.500
Arjuna was free from envy –

160
00:08:37.500 --> 00:08:39.791
he was ready to learn.

161
00:08:39.791 --> 00:08:40.958
That is why

162
00:08:40.958 --> 00:08:44.250
I gave him this divine knowledge.

163
00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:47.708
Knowledge is not just for reading –

164
00:08:47.708 --> 00:08:49.500
it is for living.

165
00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:53.208
And when we accept it with humility,

166
00:08:53.208 --> 00:08:57.041
every problem becomes an opportunity.

167
00:08:57.041 --> 00:08:59.916
Remember – true leadership

168
00:08:59.916 --> 00:09:04.000
lies not in competition, but in collaboration.

169
00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:07.000
So let go of envy,

170
00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:08.541
embrace humility,

171
00:09:08.541 --> 00:09:12.208
and invite success into your life.

172
00:09:12.208 --> 00:09:16.291
When you do your own work well

173
00:09:16.291 --> 00:09:20.458
and find joy in others' success,

174
00:09:20.458 --> 00:09:24.541
success will certainly find its way to you too.
